pve-storage-quantastor (1.1.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * v1.1.1 — packaging. Changes since 1.1.0:
  * The package now depends on multipath-tools (was Recommends) and installs
    the QuantaStor device section as /etc/multipath/conf.d/quantastor.conf
    (a conffile), so enabling multipath on a storage needs no node setup.
    The section only applies to storages with multipath on: multipathd
    claims a LUN only after the plugin whitelists its WWID.
  * README: install with "apt install ./<package>.deb", which installs the
    dependencies; dpkg -i needs "apt -f install" on a node that lacks one.

